## What breaks

Not a swap: the booking moves by one day. Tuesday shows as Monday, two attendees in two time
zones see two days, an invite arrives before its booking. That is a date converted through a time
zone. The desk noted these reports in `desk-notes.json` and counted them under the parser.

## Outcome

**Open.** The parser fix ([#1](/kb/incidents/1)) and retiring booking-v3 ([#2](/kb/incidents/2))
do not touch a time-zone shift.

